<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Oryx Sept qtr gold output leaps.</title>
<headline>Oryx Sept qtr gold output leaps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Capital spending		82.21 vs 68.69</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		 167,000 vs 4,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		  437 vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		    2.6 vs 2.1</p>
<p>* Working costs are capitalised</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    54,919 vs 54,235</p>
<p>Full name: Oryx Mine, a division of St Helena Gold Mines Ltd, owned by Gencor Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
